@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Member B - Case-Owned IntakeSession State Machine\nMB-STM-0.2 compatibility candidate, 2026-09-14
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EEF4F8
skinparam stateBorderColor #27465B
skinparam ArrowColor #27465B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF5D9

state SUBMITTED : Created with ReturnCase and original statement\nAccepted intake work queued
state EVALUATING : Selected current case/input work\nCoordinator supplies non-authoritative result
state AWAITING_CLARIFICATION : ReturnCase AWAITING_INFORMATION\nCurrent targeted ClarificationSet persisted
state CLARIFICATION_RECEIVED : Accepted statements/evidence appended\nNew input version queued for evaluation
state COMPLETE : Quiescent after handoff to UC-02\nCase continues outside intake; session remains durable
state ESCALATED_FAILURE : Quiescent after actual current technical failure\nReturnCase follows exact-target handling; session remains durable

[*] --> SUBMITTED : create_committed [fresh authorised valid request]\n/ Domain atomically creates case/session/input/work/receipt
SUBMITTED --> EVALUATING : accepted_work_started [selected current input]\n/ invoke Coordinator
EVALUATING : recoverable_processing_error [recovery budget remains]\n/ retry selected work; no duplicate customer input
EVALUATING : obsolete_result [case/input/work no longer current]\n/ discard result; do not overwrite current facts
EVALUATING --> COMPLETE : result_accepted [current binding; sufficient mandatory facts]\n/ Domain persists facts and investigation handoff
EVALUATING --> AWAITING_CLARIFICATION : result_accepted [current binding; facts incomplete/ambiguous]\n/ Domain persists remaining questions; increments internal clarification_round
EVALUATING --> ESCALATED_FAILURE : actual_processing_error [current work; recovery exhausted; legal target]\n/ Domain persists ProcessingFailure and escalation; no automatic Founder decision
AWAITING_CLARIFICATION : no_response_or_ui_closed\n/ no authoritative mutation or round-limit escalation
AWAITING_CLARIFICATION : clarification_rejected [auth/input/question/state/version invalid]\n/ safe error; no input accepted and no analysis started
AWAITING_CLARIFICATION --> CLARIFICATION_RECEIVED : clarification_committed [fresh owner request; current question set/version]\n/ atomic append and evidence binding; advance case/input; invalidate stale authority
CLARIFICATION_RECEIVED --> EVALUATING : accepted_work_started [selected current input]\n/ invoke Coordinator for updated authorised input
COMPLETE --> AWAITING_CLARIFICATION : domain_clarification_committed [G-REENTRY]\n/ adopt current questions in the same durable session
ESCALATED_FAILURE --> AWAITING_CLARIFICATION : domain_clarification_committed [G-REENTRY and lawful proposal-bound recovery]\n/ adopt current questions; never restart a no-proposal failure
COMPLETE --> [*] : case_terminal [G-TERMINAL]\n/ end session behavior; retain permitted records
ESCALATED_FAILURE --> [*] : case_terminal [G-TERMINAL]\n/ end session behavior; retain permitted records

note top of SUBMITTED
  Subject: durable case-owned IntakeSession (M-B.04 / C10).
  lifecycle_state labels and clarification_round are internal design values,
  not new wire fields, CaseStatus values or a shared IntakeStatus enum.
  G-REENTRY: Domain already committed a legal shared-case transition to
  AWAITING_INFORMATION and a current case/input-bound ClarificationSet;
  existing source/state/effect/authority guards passed. No UI-created transition.
  G-TERMINAL: authoritative ReturnCase is COMPLETED, REJECTED or MANUAL_HANDLED.
  Intake handoff or escalation alone never terminates this durable machine.
end note
note left of AWAITING_CLARIFICATION
  IntakeViewSession is a separate UI-only view/controller.
  Local DRAFT, pending/error display and closing a page do not
  create, reject, cancel, delete or expire a durable ReturnCase.
  Reopening/recovery GETs authorised current state.
  Accepted POST replay in any state creates no transition/work;
  authentication and receipt-retention rules still apply.
end note
note right of ESCALATED_FAILURE
  Ordinary missing facts are not ProcessingFailure.
  No proposal: exactly one real current failure/block target.
  This branch persists an actual COORDINATOR failure.
  Existing proposal/history remain governed by F.01.
  Founder alone can record MANUAL_HANDLING on the exact target.
  No-proposal failure has no revision/restart/re-entry path.
  With a current proposal, only lawful Founder REQUEST_REVISION
  followed by an existing assessment-gap transition may satisfy G-REENTRY.
end note
legend bottom
  Original B 92cd717; A/AI-assisted compatibility candidate; personal acceptance pending.
  AH-01 -> UC-01 / UC-01E -> M-B.04; Domain (A) remains sole business-state writer.
  No three-round business cap, seven-day archive, or customer withdrawal transition.
  COMPLETE/ESCALATED_FAILURE are durable quiescent states; only G-TERMINAL reaches final.
  This conceptual internal refinement does not alter shared class/wire contracts or implement runtime behavior.
endlegend
@enduml
